        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Ace Attorney Investigations: Miles Edgeworth is a 2009 adventure video game developed and published by Capcom. It was originally released for the Nintendo DS in Japan in 2009, and internationally in 2010, and later for iOS and Android in 2017. It is the fifth game in the Ace Attorney series, and is set between the events of the third and fourth games, Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney − Trials and Tribulations and Apollo Justice: Ace Attorney.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Ace Attorney Investigations: Miles Edgeworth es un videojuego de aventura de 2009 desarrollado y publicado por Capcom. Se lanzó originalmente para Nintendo DS en Japón en 2009 y a nivel internacional en 2010, y más tarde para iOS y Android en 2017. Es la quinta entrega de la serie Ace Attorney y transcurre entre los acontecimientos de la tercera y la cuarta entrega, Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney − Trials and Tribulations y Apollo Justice: Ace Attorney.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
